Let $a_k > 0,\ k = 1, 2, \dots, n,$ where $n \geq 1$, and let $s = \sum_{k=1}^n a_k$. Verify the following claims:
\begin{enumerate}
  \item{ $\displaystyle n \left(\sum_{k=1}^{n}\frac{a_k}{s-a_k}\right)^{-1}\quad\leq\quad n-1\quad \leq\quad \frac{1}{n}\left(\sum_{k=1}^{n}\frac{s-a_k}{a_k}\right) $}
